      <h2 id="sources">Where These Figures Come From</h2>
      <p>Every battery rating, weight and microphone count in the table above is the figure the manufacturer publishes for the model named in that row — not a measurement of our own. Prices are US list prices at the time of writing and move often. These are the vendor pages the figures were taken from:</p>
